        {
          "id": 884837028,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Did it expand `ws-view-menu.png`?  \n\n\n```\nDevelopment$ ls -l 220322*png\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 root root  8484 Mar 22 18:45 220322_ws-diagram-pane.png\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 root root 70867 Mar 22 18:45 220322_ws-view-menu.png\nDevelopment$\nDevelopment$ file 220322*png\n220322_ws-diagram-pane.png: PNG image data, 769 x 534, 8-bit colormap, non-interlaced\n220322_ws-view-menu.png:    PNG image data, 1088 x 777, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\nDevelopment$\nDevelopment$ cd wireshark/docbook/wsug_graphics/\nwsug_graphics$ ls -l ws-diagram-pane.png\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 root root 11457 Mar 22 18:46 ws-diagram-pane.png\nwsug_graphics$ ls -l ws-view-menu.png\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 root root 46179 Mar 22 18:46 ws-view-menu.png\nwsug_graphics$\nwsug_graphics$ file ws-diagram-pane.png\nws-diagram-pane.png: PNG image data, 769 x 534, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\nwsug_graphics$ file ws-view-menu.png\nws-view-menu.png: PNG image data, 1088 x 777, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\nwsug_graphics$\n```",
