          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It shouldn't have.\n\n```\n$ git --no-pager diff --stat\n .../wsug_graphics/ws-diagram-pane-popup-menu.png    | Bin 7692 -> 5452 bytes\n docbook/wsug_graphics/ws-diagram-pane.png           | Bin 11457 -> 7250 bytes\n docbook/wsug_graphics/ws-view-menu.png              | Bin 46179 -> 40750 bytes\n\n$ file $( git diff-tree --no-commit-id --name-only -r HEAD | grep '\\.png$' )\ndocbook/wsug_graphics/ws-diagram-pane-popup-menu.png: PNG image data, 767 x 284, 8-bit colormap, non-interlaced\ndocbook/wsug_graphics/ws-diagram-pane.png:            PNG image data, 769 x 534, 8-bit colormap, non-interlaced\ndocbook/wsug_graphics/ws-view-menu.png:               PNG image data, 1088 x 777, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\n```\n\nLet's try zipping them instead.\n[compressed-pngs.zip](/uploads/ed411ca563dd66627a134f8494223605/compressed-pngs.zip)",
